; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 32. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'pyCD_explorer'
pyCD_explorer.dialogstring_08C259! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1E]Explorer: Traps are[N]scattered through the[N]ruins to prevent people[N]from entering.[FIN]There's a story that says[N]this room has a mechanism[N]that reacts to sound…[FIN]Don't make any loud[N]noises, even by mistake.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08F4B1! `[DEF]A voice echoes in Will's[N]head.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Shadow: I have waited a[N]long time for this moment.[FIN]Long ago, people used the[N]comet's light to loosen[N]the bond between mind and[N]flesh.[FIN]Those who sought freedom[N]from age and death became[N]the Protectors of Light.[FIN]Those who chose mortal[N]life under Gaia became the[N]Dark Knights.[FIN]Their quarrel was over[N]what humanity should[N]become.[FIN]Shadow: Freedan was one[N]of thy ancestors. His[N]memories stir in thee for[N]his blood is thine.[FIN]I served the Protectors[N]of Light as one of their[N]champions.[FIN]But I came to reject the[N]comet's promised ending. I[N]turned to Gaia and fought[N]beside the Dark Knights.[FIN]For that, the Protectors[N]named me the[N]"Traitor of Light."[FIN]The Dark Knights knew me[N]by another name: Shadow.[FIN]When thou takest my form,[N]my memories may stir in[N]thee as Freedan's do.[FIN]Yet thy mind shall remain[N]thine own.[FIN]Close thine eyes, Will.[N]It is time to inherit my[N]form.[END]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E66C! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Thy Power of Darkness has[N]grown since Angkor Wat.[WAI][N]Stand before the statue[N]to the right, and thou[N]canst take Shadow's[N]formless shape.[WAI][N]Though born of ancient[N]light, Shadow turned from[N]its path and fought beside[N]the Dark Knights.[WAI][N]Take his form, but let thy[N]will remain thine own.[FIN]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E7E7! `[DEF][CLR][DLY:9]Will receives the Ball of[N]Aura![PAU:78][DLY:FE][FIN]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E722! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The Ball of Aura is[N]the heart that anchors[N]Shadow's form.[FIN]When raised, it lets[N]Shadow flow like water.[FIN]The Pyramid visible above[N]the sand is only a[N]fragment; most of it[N]sleeps below.[FIN]Shadow can reach the[N]buried chambers.[FIN]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCC_entrance_portal'
pyCC_entrance_portal.dialogstring_08B70D! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][SFX:10]The Pyramid's entrance is[N]vaguely reflected in the[N]blue light…[WAI][N][PAL:0] Leave it be[N] Jump inside`
pyCC_entrance_portal.dialogstring_08B74B! `[CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'pyDA_lithograph1'
pyDA_lithograph1.dialogstring_08C7C9! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]An engraved slate sits[N]in the wall.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Are these the hieroglyphs[N]I heard about in Dao?)[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]Will takes the engraved[N]slate.[FIN]`
pyDA_lithograph1.dialogstring_08C831! `[CLD][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:0][DLY:9]Will takes the engraved[N]hieroglyphic slate![PAU:70][CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039C8B! `[DEF]There's no place to put[N]the hieroglyph plate.[PAL:0][END]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCD_jackal'
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BA11! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:0]Be a good boy and stand[N]to the left…!![END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BA36! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]I said, stand to the[N]left…!![END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BA5A! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Alright, that's good. Stay[N]still just like that…!![END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BA7D! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: Don't struggle,[N]Princess. Your life means[N]nothing to me.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]If I get what I came for,[N]there's no need for you[N]to die.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Is that what you[N]tell all your victims so[N]they won't struggle?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: Actually, yes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]It even works sometimes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: I've learned a lot[N]chasing you, boy.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]The comet will soon pass[N]close to this world.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Under its light, people[N]will change. Some may[N]become beasts.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: Your parents knew[N]that much, Princess.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]That's why they wanted the[N]Crystal Ring. They thought[N]it could protect them.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: My parents…?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: They hired me to[N]bring it back.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: If they hired you,[N]why are you keeping it[N]for yourself?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: Because I've[N]needed it for years.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]I was at Babel with[N]Olman's expedition.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]I was the one [PAU:18]who set off[N]the trap.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Just another job.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]But the comet's light[N]touched me too.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]It didn't change me all[N]at once.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]It's been working on me[N]ever since.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Some who are touched lose[N]their human shape.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Others lose their bodies[N]entirely.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]I don't know what it's[N]making me into.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]And I don't intend to[N]find out.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]But after coming this far,[N]I won't hand it over.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]That ring is mine.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: …Wait.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Princess… your hand.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: This ring?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: So you've been[N]carrying it all along.[END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BC55! `[DEF]A voice whispers in Will's[N]mind[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Will[AD] Play the[N]flute[AD][N]Trust what answers.[END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BCBC! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: Come any closer[N]and this knife moves[AD][END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BC9F! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: [N]Give up...? [N][PAL:0][END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BCF2! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:0]Jackal:[N]Uwhaaaaaaaagh!![PAU:3C][CLD]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BD16! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:4]Kara… Kara…[PAU:78][CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCD_kara'
pyCD_kara.dialogstring_08BE66! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2]Kara: Will…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2]Why does everyone keep[N]trying to hurt each other?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2]My parents. Jackal. The[N]slave merchants…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2]I thought leaving the[N]castle would show me a[N]simpler world. It didn't.[END]`
pyCD_kara.dialogstring_08BEA9! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I'm sorry. I lost[N]myself for a moment.[WAI][N]I came because I wanted[N]to help you, not become[N]another thing you have[N]to protect.[WAI][N]My parents sent him[N]after the ring.[N]I don't know what to[N]believe about either of[N]them anymore.[WAI][N]But I don't regret coming.[N]Not for a second.[WAI][N]Find the fifth Mystic[N]Statue. I'll be alright.[END]`
pyCD_kara.dialogstring_08BF8F! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: That melody you[N]played[AD] It sounded almost[N]like a funeral song for[N]Jackal.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039BA5! `[DEF][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]There are six hollows[N]where a tile can fit. [FIN]Put it where?[N] 1st from L. 4th from L.[N] 2nd from L. 5th from L.[N] 3rd from L. 6th from L.`
item_use_system.dialogstring_039C39! `[CLR][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will fits the slate into[N]the recess.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCD_puzzle'
pyCD_puzzle.dialogstring_08CCC4! `[DEF]Nothing happens[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Did I get the order[N]wrong? I should try again[N]from the beginning.)[END]`
pyCD_puzzle.dialogstring_08CD0B! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](What was that sound?[N]Just past the entrance[AD])[END]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCC_portal'
pyCC_portal.dialogstring_08CDDA! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:10]The mummified queen of the[N]Pyramid is projected in[N]the blue light…[WAI][N][PAL:0] Leave it alone[N] Jump inside`
pyCC_portal.dialogstring_08CE10! `[CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'pyDD_mystic_statue'
pyDD_mystic_statue.dialogstring_08CE60! `[SFX:10][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:10]The Pyramid's guardian[N]falls. Will finds a[N]Mystic Statue beside it.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCD_kara'
pyCD_kara.dialogstring_08BFC7! `[CLD][DEF]A voice comes from the[N]flute.[FIN]It is the same voice Will[N]heard in Edward Castle's[N]prison.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:1]Flute: You've come far,[N]Will.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@CastleV051Will][DLY:1]Will: Dad?![FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:1]Flute: I'm at the Tower of[N]Babel.[FIN]Bring the five Mystic[N]Statues you've gathered[N]to me.[FIN]The final one is here.[N]The statues belong to an[N]ancient rite.[FIN]Their purpose concerns[N]mankind's future, not[N]just its survival.[FIN]The comet is almost here.[N]Will… Hurry…[FIN][CLD][DEF]The voice fades until only[N]the flute remains.[END]`
pyCD_kara.dialogstring_08C127! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I hate this feeling…[N]like something huge is[N]happening around us and we[N]can only see part of it.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Dad wants us at[N]Babel, but how do we reach[N]an island in the open sea?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Neil's still in Dao,[N]right?[WAI][N]If anyone can get us out[N]to Babel, it's him. Let's[N]go back and ask.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC8_neil'
daC8_neil.dialogstring_08A73C! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: You're going no[N]matter what I say, aren't[N]you?[WAI][N]A year ago I'd have called[N]that stubbornness.[WAI][N]Now I know you can make[N]that choice for yourself.[WAI][N]I'll fly you to Babel,[N]then take Kara and Erik[N]back toward South Cape.[WAI][N]And yes, I fixed the[N]aeroplane this time.[N][SFX:A]Probably.[END]`

sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08EFEF! `[DEF][DLY:9]Will has the Ball of Aura![FIN]`
